Origin line: histor.modelmarket.dev/log (equal to the vkey key name). Key typ=
e 0x01, Ed25519. Checkpoint: https://histor.modelmarket.dev/checkpoint https:=
//histor.modelmarket.dev/checkpoint Add-checkpoint rate: one request per witn=
ess every 10 minutes (144 per day), from a timer on the log's host. The log o=
nly grows; consistency proofs are served at https://histor.modelmarket.dev/ap=
i/v1/log/proof/consistency?first=3D&second=3D https://histor.modelmarket.dev/=
api/v1/log/proof/consistency?first=3D&second=3D and the witness client handle=
s 409 by resubmitting from the witness's size. What it is: HISTOR is a public=
, append-only log of the tool definitions that MCP (Model Context Protocol) s=
ervers listed in the official MCP registry actually serve. Each observation b=
ecomes a signed statement, and the statements are leaves of an RFC 9162 Merkl=
e tree (currently about 1.29 million leaves, growing by a few thousand a day)=
. The format is specified at https://github.com/alexar76/histor/blob/main/doc=
s/spec/transparency-log.md https://github.com/alexar76/histor/blob/main/docs/=
spec/transparency-log.md with test vectors; the checkpoint and note formats w=
ere checked byte for byte against golang.org/x/mod/sumdb/note and github.com/=
transparency-dev/formats/note. Intended users: MCP clients and security tooli=
ng that want to check whether the tool definitions they received are the ones=
 the server serves to everyone (split-view detection for tool definitions), a=
nd researchers using the weekly open dataset (doi:10.5281/zenodo.23512759). W=
itness cosignatures are what would turn the log's own signed heads into evide=
nce that it shows everyone the same tree. Load versus utility: 144 add-checkp=
oint requests per witness per day, small checkpoints, no burst. Expected life=
time: long-lived; the log has run since September 2026 and the origin and key=
 will not change. The same instance also implements c2sp.org/tlog-witness htt=
ps://histor.modelmarket.dev/witness/v1, https://histor.modelmarket.dev/witnes=
s/v1, key histor.modelmarket.dev/witness+87df9f83+BHmgo3SRWlaehFMgWBDIOWFgs1V=
2YQS+ufBcg/ht6kw/). It is not offered as a network witness yet; if that would=
 be useful once it has run for a while, I would be glad to discuss it separat=
ely. Thank you, Aleksandr Artamokhov



